repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/interactor-character-domain-c-abi
abstract: >-
  The character domain C-ABI: a pure-Lean reference model for character work
  (rig, skin, pose, roll-orientation normalization, harness-bone removal),
  bridged to the RISC-V godot-sandbox guest through the rectgtn-style C-ABI.
  The domain unions with the RECTGTN GTN planner by requiring it over GitHub, so
  a character goal is an ordinary RECTGTN task node.
